  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Humanitarian Assistance to Populations Affected by Conflict and Natural Hazards in Central and Northern Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2012, Mali has been experiencing a violent conflict that has disrupted communities, displaced hundreds of thousands of people and caused thousands of deaths. Massive population displacements continue to occur due to recurring armed violence and various threats from unidentified armed groups. This project&#x2019;s overall objective is to contribute to the humanitarian response and the efforts of the Government of Mali to coordinate the provision of lifesaving assistance to populations affected by conflict and disasters in the Center and North of the country across formal and informal sites.</narrative>
  </description>
